"elapsed‑time measurement::"
msgstr ""
"Modul :mod:`time` mencakup penundaan blocking, tick monotonic, dan "
"pengukuran waktu yang berlalu::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:692
msgid "Virtual timers"
msgstr "Timer virtual"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:694
msgid ""
":ref:`machine.Timer <machine.Timer>` schedules periodic or one‑shot "
"callbacks without consuming a hardware timer slot. Pass ``-1`` as the id to "
"use a virtual (software) timer::"
msgstr ""
":ref:`machine.Timer <machine.Timer>` menjadwalkan callback periodik atau "
"one‑shot tanpa mengkonsumsi slot timer hardware. Berikan ``-1`` sebagai id "
"untuk menggunakan timer virtual (perangkat lunak)::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:708
msgid ""
"Period values are in milliseconds. Call :meth:`~machine.Timer.deinit` to "
"stop and release the slot."
msgstr ""
"Nilai periode dalam milidetik. Panggil :meth:`~machine.Timer.deinit` untuk "
"menghentikan dan melepaskan slot."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:712
msgid "Real‑time clock"
msgstr "Real‑time clock"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:714
msgid ""
":ref:`machine.RTC <machine.RTC>` keeps wall‑clock time across resets and "
"(with the optional 3.3 V backup battery wired to the rear pads, see *Power "
"pins*) across full power loss::"
msgstr ""
":ref:`machine.RTC <machine.RTC>` menjaga waktu jam dinding melewati reset "
"dan (dengan baterai cadangan 3,3 V opsional yang dihubungkan ke pad "
"belakang, lihat *Pin daya*\\ ) melewati kehilangan daya penuh::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:724
msgid ""
"The RTC also runs through deep sleep, so you can use it as a wakeup source "
"for :func:`machine.deepsleep`."
msgstr ""
"RTC juga berjalan melalui deep sleep, sehingga Anda dapat menggunakannya "
"sebagai sumber wakeup untuk :func:`machine.deepsleep`\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:728
msgid "Watchdog"
msgstr "Watchdog"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:730
msgid ""
":ref:`machine.WDT <machine.WDT>` resets the board if the application hangs. "
"Once started it can't be stopped or reconfigured — feed it periodically "
"inside your main loop::"
msgstr ""
":ref:`machine.WDT <machine.WDT>` mereset papan jika aplikasi hang. Setelah "
"dimulai, watchdog tidak dapat dihentikan atau dikonfigurasi ulang — beri "
"makan secara berkala di dalam loop utama Anda::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:742
msgid "Boot and runtime info"
msgstr "Info boot dan runtime"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:745
msgid "USB bootloader window"
msgstr "Jendela bootloader USB"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:747
msgid ""
"On every power‑up the camera runs a short bootloader (a few seconds) that "
"lets OpenMV IDE update the firmware without the user having to enter DFU "
"mode. After the window expires the bootloader hands off to ``boot.py`` and "
"then ``main.py``."
msgstr ""
"Pada setiap power‑up, kamera menjalankan bootloader singkat (beberapa detik)"
" yang memungkinkan OpenMV IDE memperbarui firmware tanpa pengguna harus "
"masuk ke mode DFU. Setelah jendela berakhir, bootloader menyerahkan ke "
"``boot.py`` lalu ke ``main.py``\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:752
msgid ""
"A running script can re‑enter the bootloader on demand by calling "
":func:`machine.bootloader`::"
msgstr ""
"Skrip yang sedang berjalan dapat masuk kembali ke bootloader sesuai "
"permintaan dengan memanggil :func:`machine.bootloader`\\ ::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:760
msgid "Filesystem and boot order"
msgstr "Filesystem dan urutan boot"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:762
msgid "The N6 firmware mounts up to three filesystems on boot:"
msgstr "Firmware N6 memasang hingga tiga filesystem saat boot:"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:764
msgid ""
"**Internal flash** — always mounted at ``/flash``. Holds ``main.py`` and "
"``README.txt`` by default; created on the very first boot."
msgstr ""
"**Flash internal** — selalu dipasang di ``/flash``\\ . Menyimpan ``main.py``"
" dan ``README.txt`` secara default; dibuat pada boot pertama."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:766
msgid "**microSD card** — if a card is inserted it is mounted at ``/sdcard``."
msgstr ""
"**Kartu microSD** — jika kartu dimasukkan, kartu dipasang di ``/sdcard``\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:768
msgid ""
"**ROMFS** — read‑only, memory‑mapped filesystem at ``/rom`` used to ship "
"large data assets (e.g. AI models) that benefit from zero‑copy access. "
"Mounted automatically by MicroPython at startup, before any user Python "
"runs."
msgstr ""
"**ROMFS** — filesystem read‑only, memory‑mapped di ``/rom`` yang digunakan "
"untuk mengirimkan aset data besar (misalnya model AI) yang mendapat manfaat "
"dari akses zero‑copy. Dipasang secara otomatis oleh MicroPython saat "
"startup, sebelum Python pengguna mana pun berjalan."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:773
msgid ""
"After mounting, the working directory is set to ``/sdcard`` when the card is"
" present, otherwise ``/flash``. The interpreter then runs scripts from that "
"directory:"
msgstr ""
"Setelah pemasangan, direktori kerja diatur ke ``/sdcard`` saat kartu "
"tersedia, jika tidak ke ``/flash``\\ . Interpreter kemudian menjalankan "
"skrip dari direktori tersebut:"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:777
msgid ""
"``boot.py`` is executed on **every** soft reset (cold boot, ``Ctrl‑D`` from "
"the REPL, or whenever the running script returns)."
msgstr ""
"``boot.py`` dijalankan pada **setiap** soft reset (cold boot, ``Ctrl‑D`` "
"dari REPL, atau setiap kali skrip yang berjalan kembali)."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:779
msgid ""
"``main.py`` is executed **only on cold boot**, immediately after "
"``boot.py``. Subsequent soft resets re‑run ``boot.py`` but drop straight to "
"the REPL — to re‑run ``main.py`` you have to fully reset the board."
msgstr ""
"``main.py`` dijalankan **hanya pada cold boot**\\ , segera setelah "
"``boot.py``\\ . Soft reset berikutnya menjalankan ulang ``boot.py`` tetapi "
"langsung ke REPL — untuk menjalankan ulang ``main.py`` Anda harus mereset "
"papan sepenuhnya."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:784
msgid ""
"Dropping a ``boot.py`` or ``main.py`` onto the SD card overrides the copy in"
" flash without touching it — both files are looked up in the boot directory "
"(``/sdcard`` when the card is mounted, otherwise ``/flash``)."
msgstr ""
"Meletakkan ``boot.py`` atau ``main.py`` ke kartu SD akan mengganti salinan "
"di flash tanpa menyentuhnya — kedua file dicari di direktori boot (\\ "
"``/sdcard`` saat kartu dipasang, jika tidak ``/flash``\\ )."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:789
msgid ""
"The default ``main.py`` shipped on a freshly flashed board just blinks the "
"user RGB LED's **blue** channel as a heartbeat (two short pulses, short "
"gap), so you can tell the firmware booted cleanly without any host attached."
msgstr ""
"``main.py`` default yang dikirimkan pada papan yang baru di-flash hanya "
"mengedipkan saluran **biru** LED RGB pengguna sebagai heartbeat (dua pulsa "
"pendek, jeda pendek), sehingga Anda dapat mengetahui bahwa firmware telah "
"boot dengan bersih tanpa host yang terpasang."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:794
msgid ""
"``sys.path`` is extended to include all three filesystems and their ``lib/``"
" subdirectories, so importable modules can live in ``/flash/lib``, "
"``/sdcard/lib``, or ``/rom/lib``."
msgstr ""
"``sys.path`` diperluas untuk menyertakan ketiga filesystem dan subdirektori "
"``lib/``\\ -nya, sehingga modul yang dapat diimpor dapat berada di "
"``/flash/lib``\\ , ``/sdcard/lib``\\ , atau ``/rom/lib``\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:798
msgid ""
"To force the system to ignore an inserted SD card (for example to run the "
"flash ``main.py`` even with a card present), create an empty file named "
"``SKIPSD`` at the root of ``/flash``."
msgstr ""
"Untuk memaksa sistem mengabaikan kartu SD yang dimasukkan (misalnya untuk "
"menjalankan ``main.py`` flash meskipun ada kartu), buat file kosong bernama "
"``SKIPSD`` di root ``/flash``\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:802
msgid ""
"When connected over USB, the boot filesystem (``/sdcard`` if a card is "
"present, otherwise ``/flash``) also enumerates as a USB mass‑storage drive "
"on the host, letting you edit ``boot.py``, ``main.py``, and any other files "
"directly. **Eject the drive before resetting the camera** so the host "
"flushes its cached writes."
msgstr ""
"Ketika terhubung melalui USB, filesystem boot (\\ ``/sdcard`` jika ada "
"kartu, jika tidak ``/flash``\\ ) juga dihitung sebagai drive USB "
"mass‑storage di host, memungkinkan Anda mengedit ``boot.py``\\ , "
"``main.py``\\ , dan file lain secara langsung. **Eject drive sebelum mereset"
" kamera** agar host membuang penulisan yang di-cache."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:810
msgid ""
"Because the OS treats the drive as a passive block device, files created or "
"modified by code running on the OpenMV Cam will not show up until the host "
"re‑mounts the drive. If both the OS and the OpenMV Cam write the same "
"filesystem at the same time, the OS will win and overwrite changes made by "
"the camera. Use the SD card for any data the script writes back, and remount"
" before reading those files from the host."
msgstr ""
"Karena OS memperlakukan drive sebagai perangkat blok pasif, file yang dibuat"
" atau dimodifikasi oleh kode yang berjalan pada OpenMV Cam tidak akan muncul"
" sampai host me-mount ulang drive. Jika OS dan OpenMV Cam menulis filesystem"
" yang sama secara bersamaan, OS akan menang dan menimpa perubahan yang "
"dibuat oleh kamera. Gunakan kartu SD untuk data apa pun yang ditulis kembali"
" oleh skrip, dan mount ulang sebelum membaca file tersebut dari host."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:820
msgid ""
"The user RGB LED's **red** channel may briefly light up while the host is "
"reading from or writing to the USB mass‑storage drive — this is a "
"firmware‑driven activity indicator, not a fault."
msgstr ""
"Saluran **merah** LED RGB pengguna mungkin menyala sebentar saat host "
"membaca dari atau menulis ke drive USB mass‑storage — ini adalah indikator "
"aktivitas yang digerakkan firmware, bukan kesalahan."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:825
msgid "Storage sizes"
msgstr "Ukuran penyimpanan"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:827
msgid "The N6 ships with:"
msgstr "N6 dikirimkan dengan:"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:829
msgid "``/flash`` — **4 MB** FAT filesystem, read/write."
msgstr "``/flash`` — filesystem FAT **4 MB**\\ , baca/tulis."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:830
msgid ""
"``/rom`` — **24 MB** read-only memory-mapped ROMFS, used to ship scripts and"
" ML models that benefit from zero-copy mmap access."
msgstr ""
"``/rom`` — ROMFS read-only yang dipetakan ke memori **24 MB**\\ , digunakan "
"untuk mengirimkan skrip dan model ML yang mendapat manfaat dari akses mmap "
"zero-copy."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:833
msgid ""
"``/sdcard`` — full size of whatever microSD card is inserted (when present),"
" read/write."
msgstr ""
"``/sdcard`` — ukuran penuh kartu microSD yang dimasukkan (jika ada), "
"baca/tulis."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:837
msgid "Hard‑fault indicator"
msgstr "Indikator hard‑fault"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:839
msgid ""
"If the user RGB LED is rapidly cycling through all colours — fast enough "
"that it tends to look like a **twinkling white LED** rather than distinct "
"hues — the firmware has hit an unrecoverable hard fault. Reflash the "
"firmware to recover; if reflashing doesn't help, the board may be physically"
" damaged."
msgstr ""
"Jika LED RGB pengguna berputar cepat melalui semua warna — cukup cepat "
"sehingga cenderung terlihat seperti **LED putih berkelip** daripada warna "
"yang berbeda — firmware telah mengalami hard fault yang tidak dapat "
"dipulihkan. Flash ulang firmware untuk memulihkan; jika mem-flash ulang "
"tidak membantu, papan mungkin rusak secara fisik."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:846
msgid "Software libraries"
msgstr "Pustaka perangkat lunak"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:848
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`library index </library/index>` for the full list of modules —"
" including which ones are unique to the N6 build."
msgstr ""
"Lihat :doc:`indeks library </library/index>` untuk daftar lengkap modul — "
"termasuk yang unik untuk build N6."
